      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Callum from Infinite came first and was punctual, polite, clear and well informed. The phone appointment booker was also very good.The installation was tricky for them due to the power board being on the other side of the house to the battery location but they did a great job with difficult cabling. Our terracotta roof tiles were fragile and they replaced a lot at their own cost due to the size of the job. The team were all friendly, tidy and professional. We are still waiting for the smart meter install (which is not their role) and Callum will return to guide us through the remaining management once that has happened. Have been recommending Infinite to anyone who has asked.Thought you might like to know that Damien Slaven from Soltek didn't want to come out until I'd seen his ballpark quote (\"don't want to waste your time and mine\"). When I told him I was interested in a SIGENergy battery, he criticised the battery and said they'd only been in Australia 6 mths. I said they were currently the most popular new battery and he said \"Yeah, well there will be a lot of tears when they go wrong.\" He repeated this line to a friend of mine who is also interested in a battery. I looked them up and they've been in Australia two years. I was unimpressed with his approach.Renew Solar were very busy and by the earliest they could come to quote was 21 August by which time we had already confirmed with Infinite.",
